WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.880
Well, first of all, the black people in Chicago are thrilled that we're getting the illegal aliens out of their communities who are stealing their housing, jobs, and resources.

00:06.880 --> 00:15.780
You've seen the video of the town halls during the Biden administration where black citizens who are natives of Chicago were begging to have the illegals taken out of their country.

00:16.340 --> 00:24.120
What they've done is they've created a system of law in Chicago, in Illinois, where illegal aliens have far more rights than American citizens.

00:24.120 --> 00:31.060
If an American citizen, for example, commits a crime of sexual predation against a child, they'll cooperate with the FBI.

00:31.180 --> 00:37.320
If an illegal alien commits a crime of sexual predation against a child, that illegal alien will be shielded in an ICE no-go zone.

00:37.640 --> 00:43.440
I ask you the question, what is the right term to describe a local official declaring a no-go zone for ICE?

00:43.600 --> 00:46.120
Would you tolerate it for FBI, ATF, DEA?

00:46.740 --> 00:47.680
No, you would not.

00:47.680 --> 00:54.400
But there is an effort to delegitimize the core function of the federal government of enforcing our immigration laws and our sovereignty.

00:54.960 --> 00:56.000
It is domestic terrorism.

00:56.420 --> 00:57.200
It is insurrection.

00:57.780 --> 01:06.100
And no amount of insane, hyperventilating lies from Pritzker or Johnson or any other Democratic official will change our minds on that.

01:06.480 --> 01:10.940
ICE officers should not have to live in fear and violence to do their jobs.

01:11.260 --> 01:11.520
Period.

01:11.520 --> 01:21.080
So on the substance of the question, is it the case that as Pritzker frames it, you are profiling brown people,

01:21.560 --> 01:27.080
that this immigration crackdown is designed to go after people of color?

